id: masterful-dodge
name: Masterful Dodge
talentCategory: dodging
prerequisites: Instinctual Dodge, Agility Score of 10+, Tier of Power 3+
description: >
  Having mastered the elusive technique of dodging without intent, your evasive skills are without equal.
text: >
  Masterful Dodge: Having mastered the elusive technique of dodging without intent, your evasive skills are without equal.
  –Prerequisites: Instinctual Dodge, Agility Score of 10+, Tier of Power 3+
  (1)-[Passive]: Roll your Base Die twice for any Dodge Roll and use the highest result.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: Until the start of your next turn, ignore all penalties to your Dodge Rolls.

---

[passive]
# (1) Any Dodge Roll's Base Die rolled twice, the higher kept (chat.mjs rollSide, evaluateCheck).
allow dodge.baseDieTwice;

# (2) As your turn starts, once an Encounter: Masterful Dodge (a mark) till the start of your next turn - every penalty on your
# Dodge Rolls left off, what effects take off your Defense Value among them (chat.mjs strikePenaltiesIgnored). Automatic by
# default, its Triggered/Automatic button; set Triggered, ticked on the turn's card.
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/encounter, effect 2]
gain(masterful-dodge-mark);
expires(masterful-dodge-mark, start-of-next-turn);
